[h2]Build 0.9.2[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Farming tab listing every growing zone, hydroponics basin and plant pot: crop, cells, soil fertility, crop growth and nutrition produced per day.
[*]How many people each zone feeds eaten raw, cooked into simple meals, or as nutrient paste, with totals against what your colonists, slaves and prisoners actually eat.
[*]Right now or year-average view; outdoor fields follow your map's growing season.
[*]Animal feed crops are counted against your animals' needs.
[*]Warnings for zones too cold or hot to grow, short of light, on soil too poor for the crop, or with sowing turned off.
[*]Click a row to jump to the zone.
[*]Settings: count harvests at your best grower's yield or a flat 100%, and show or hide non-food crops.
[/list]
